#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x5b1b1f
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Destroy the obstacle<C=R> in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia to clear a path forward. Reach the target point and blow the obstacle up with C4 Charges.\n"
"<C=FF4040>MSF SOLDIERS ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 8:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Weapons Needed: <C=FF4040>C4 Charges<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>摧毁障碍物<C=R>，在中埃雷迪亚的云雾林开辟前进道路。抵达目标点，用C4炸毁障碍物。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅 MSF 士兵<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：8:00\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n"
"  所需武器：<C=FF4040>C4<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

