"摧毁车辆或制伏敌方士兵即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x5d1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Shoot all the targets<C=R> in the Enemy Base along Río del Jade.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 2:00\n"
"  Time Bonus: +3 to 7 sec. for each target hit\n"
"  # of Targets: 16"
