"<C=FF4040>拆除翡翠河沿岸敌军基地内所有克莱莫地雷<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>触发地雷会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：4:00\n"
"  时间奖励：每拆除一个地雷+10秒\n"
"  目标数：8"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x801b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the tropical dry forest of Volcán Irazú and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr ""
"潜入伊拉苏火山热带干林，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x801b22
msgid "ABOUT SBM115"
msgstr "关于SBM115"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Retrieve the items<C=R> from the Ruinas de Xochiquetzal, located in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia.  <C=FF4040>Beware of Ghosts.<C=R>\n"
"<C=FF4040>No LIFE regeneration items allowed.<C=R>\n"
"  Time Limit: 3:00 (30 sec. penalty for triggering an alert)\n"
"  # of Targets: 3"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>取得索奇克察尔遗迹内物品<C=R>，位于中埃雷迪亚云雾林。<C=FF4040>当心幽灵。<C=R>\n"
"<C=FF4040>禁止使用生命值回复道具。<C=R>\n"
"  时间限制：3:00（触发警报罚30秒）\n"
"  目标数：3"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr ""
"潜入中埃雷迪亚云雾林，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b22
msgid "ABOUT SBM116"
msgstr "关于SBM116"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x821b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x831b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x841b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9b1b26
