msgid "Zadornov Search Mission"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫搜索任务"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95ac9d
msgid ""
"Infiltrate the supply facility at Puerto del Alba, the coastal port where Paz was imprisoned, and obtain intel on the bases of the armed group occupying Costa Rica.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SNAKE ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>."
msgstr ""
"潜入黎明港补给设施——帕兹曾被囚禁的沿海港口，获取占领哥斯达黎加的武装组织基地情报。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅SNAKE可用<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95ac9e
msgid "Follow the nukes and infiltrate the enemy's main base inside the Crater of Irazú."
msgstr "追踪核弹，潜入伊拉苏火山口内敌军主基地。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95aca1
msgid "Head North toward Central Heredia, where Dr. Strangelove's lab lies hidden among Mayan Ruins."
msgstr "北往埃雷迪亚中部，斯特兰奇洛夫博士实验室藏在玛雅遗迹中。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95aca2
msgid "Make your way to the bottom of the Underground Base and stop Peace Walker before it is complete."
msgstr "前往地下基地最深处，在和平行者完成前阻止它。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95aca5
msgid "Peace Walker is almost complete. Head for the hangar where it is housed."
msgstr "和平行者即将完成。前往存放它的机库。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95aca6
msgid "Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base yet again. Find him and bring him back. "
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并带回来。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95aca9
msgid "Believe it or not, Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base again. Find him and bring him back.  "
msgstr "信不信由你，扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并带回来。"

