"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x95fef0
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Force all prospective MSF members into submission<C=R> using only CQC and melee attacks.\n"
"Forcing all recruits into submission before time runs out will result in all of them joining MSF."
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>仅用CQC和近身攻击制伏所有MSF候选成员<C=R>。\n"
"在时间耗尽前制伏所有新兵，他们就会全部加入MSF。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9b1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to rescue the researcher<C=R> held prisoner at the Cafetal Aroma Encantado Coffee Plantation.\n"
"  Time Limit: 13:00 (before prisoner is moved)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>用富尔顿回收系统营救研究员<C=R>，他被囚禁在芳香咖啡种植园。\n"
"  时间限制：13:00（囚犯被转移前）\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9b1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize all enemy mercenaries<C=R> at the Small Maintenance Dock of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua. Non-lethal methods such as knocking enemies unconscious, holding them up, or putting them to sleep are acceptable.\n"
"  Time Limit: 5:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 30 sec. for triggering an alert\n"
"  # of Targets: 5"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>制伏尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地小型维修码头的所有敌方雇佣兵<C=R>。可使用击晕、举枪胁迫或催眠等非致命手段。\n"
"  时间限制：5:00\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加30秒\n"
"  目标数：5"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9c1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to rescue the researcher<C=R> held prisoner at the Sorting Shed in Bananal Fruta de Oro.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 7:00 (before prisoner is moved)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>用富尔顿回收系统营救研究员<C=R>，他被囚禁在黄金果香蕉园分拣棚。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：7:00（囚犯被转移前）\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9c1b22
msgid ""
"Use the Fulton Recovery System to <C=FF4040>rescue the U.S. soldier<C=R> from the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua. He was wounded in the attack by the Soviet occupying force.\n"
"  Time Limit: 4:00 (until U.S. soldier dies)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 30 sec. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"使用富尔顿回收系统从尼加拉瓜的美国导弹基地<C=FF4040>救出美军士兵<C=R>。他在苏联占领军的袭击中负伤。\n"
"  时间限制：4:00（直到美军士兵死亡）\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加罚30秒\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9d1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to rescue the researcher<C=R> held prisoner at the Prison Facility at Aldea Los Despiertos.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 5:00 (before prisoner is moved)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 30 sec. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>使用富尔顿回收救出<C=R>被关押在觉醒者村收容设施的研究员。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：5:00（在囚犯被转移前）\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报加罚30秒\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9d1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Go on a date with Paz<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SNAKE ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: None\n"
"  Weapons Needed: No lethal weapons allowed\n"
"  Items Needed: Something Paz would like"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>与帕兹约会<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅斯内克可用<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：无\n"
"  所需武器：禁止使用致命武器\n"
"  所需物品：帕兹会喜欢的东西"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9e1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to rescue the FSLN POWs<C=R> being held in the specified area of the Cloud forest in Central Heredia.\n"
"  Time Limit: 5:00 (Complete before the prisoner is moved. 1 min. penalty for triggering an alert.)\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery Device<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>使用富尔顿回收救出<C=R>被关押在中部埃雷迪亚云雾林指定区域的FSLN战俘。\n"
"  时间限制：5:00（在囚犯被转移前完成。触发警报罚1分钟。）\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收装置<C=R>\n"
"  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9e1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Go on a date with Kaz<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SNAKE ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: None\n"
"  Weapons Needed: No lethal weapons allowed\n"
"  Items Needed: Something Kaz would like"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>与卡兹约会<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅斯内克可用<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：无\n"
"  所需武器：禁止使用致命武器\n"
"  所需物品：卡兹会喜欢的东西"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9f1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Recover the researcher<C=R> being held in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia.\n"
"This researcher has <C=FF4040>disguised himself as an enemy mercenary<C=R> to escape detection.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Losing sight of the researcher or killing him will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 7:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 30 sec. for triggering an alert / 30\n"
"    sec. when player uses Fulton Recovery on any\n"
"    soldier other than the disguised researcher\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>救回被关押在Central Heredia云雾森林的研究员<C=R>。\n"
"这名研究员<C=FF4040>伪装成敌方雇佣兵<C=R>以躲避侦查。\n"
"<C=FF4040>跟丢研究员或将其杀死将导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n"
"<C=FF4040>仅限单人游戏<C=R>。\n"
"  时间限制：7:00\n"
"  时间惩罚：触发警报扣30秒 / 玩家对\n"
"    伪装研究员以外的任何士兵使用富尔顿回收\n"
"    时扣30秒\n"
"  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n"
"  目标数量：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9f1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Target practice<C=R> at Mother Base's Kill House. You have unlimited ammo.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Exit the Kill House to end<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>. \n"
