"SNAKE在哥伦比亚MSF“无国界士兵”总部训练时听到有人叫他的名字。\n"
"  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5ac9d
msgid "Delve into the swampy jungles of Eastern Limón and make your way to the Sandinista hideout, where you will make contact with their Comandante."
msgstr "深入利蒙东部的沼泽丛林，前往桑地诺派藏身处，与他们的指挥官取得联系。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca1
