msgstr "制伏敌方攻击直升机。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca5
msgid "Stop Peace Walker!"
msgstr "阻止和平行者！"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb5aca9
msgid "Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base again. Find him and bring him back. "
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫又从母基地逃走了。找到他并把他带回来。"

