"<C=FF4040>狩猎轰龙<C=R>。\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb60159
msgid ""
"Galvez introduces himself as a \"professor\" from Costa Rica and presents his request to Snake.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr ""
"加尔维斯自称是来自哥斯达黎加的“教授”，向SNAKE提出请求。\n"
"  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb70159
msgid ""
"Snake infiltrates the inner coastal facility where Paz was imprisoned to investigate the U.S. mercenary base.\n"
"  From \"Opening / Investigate the Supply Facility\""
msgstr ""
"SNAKE潜入帕兹曾被关押的沿岸内部设施，调查美军雇佣兵基地。\n"
"  出自“序幕／调查补给设施”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb80159
msgid ""
"In order to gather information about the local area, Snake heads to a boathouse to make contact with the FSLN Comandante.\n"
"  From \"Contact the Sandinista Comandante\""
msgstr ""
"为收集当地情报，SNAKE前往船屋与FSLN指挥官接触。\n"
"  出自“接触桑地诺派指挥官”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xb90159
msgid ""
"Snake makes it to the Banana Plantation in pursuit of Amanda.\n"
"  From \"Pursue Amanda\""
msgstr ""
"SNAKE追至香蕉园寻找阿曼达。\n"
"  出自“追踪阿曼达”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xba0159
msgid ""
"After battling with the armored vehicle, Snake notices Amanda's presence up ahead.\n"
"  From \"Armored Vehicle Battle: LAV-Type G\""
msgstr ""
"与装甲车交战后，SNAKE发现阿曼达就在前方。\n"
"  出自“装甲车战：LAV-Type G”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbb0159
msgid ""
"Snake finds Amanda's little brother, Chico, in the Irazú Prison Facility.\n"
"  From \"Resuce Chico\""
msgstr ""
"SNAKE在伊拉苏收容设施找到阿曼达的弟弟奇科。\n"
"  出自“营救奇科”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbb1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend all targets and defeat the enemy force<C=R> in the Mine Base.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all supplies to be destroyed will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 30 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr ""
"<C=FF4040>守住所有目标并击退敌军<C=R>，地点在矿井基地。\n"
"<C=FF4040>所有补给被摧毁将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n"
"  目标数：30（士兵数）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xbc0159
msgid ""
"Utilizing the information provided by Chico, Snake makes his way to the railroad transport route.\n"
"  From \"Pursue the Jungle Train\""
msgstr ""
"利用奇科提供的情报，SNAKE前往铁路运输路线。\n"
"  出自“追踪丛林列车”"

